3},"end":{"line":35,"column":58,"offset":1240}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"if instruction.get_program_id() != &pinocchio_system::ID {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData);\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1,"offset":1244},"end":{"line":41,"column":4,"offset":1374}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-3"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"接下來，我們檢查指令是否是我們預期的。為此，我們將鑑別器和指令數據與預期值進行比較。我們首先創建一個 ","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":1378},"end":{"line":43,"column":52,"offset":1429}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"instruction_data","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":52,"offset":1429},"end":{"line":43,"column":70,"offset":1447}}},{"type":"text","value":" 變量並進行檢查，如下所示：","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":70,"offset":1447},"end":{"line":43,"column":84,"offset":1461}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1,"offset":1378},"end":{"line":43,"column":84,"offset":1461}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"let mut instruction_data = [0u8; 12];\r\ninstruction_data[0..4].copy_from_slice(&2u32.to_le_bytes());\r\ninstruction_data[4..12].copy_from_slice(&100_000_000u64.to_le_bytes());\r\n\r\nif instruction.get_instruction_data() != instruction_data {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData);\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1,"offset":1465},"end":{"line":53,"column":4,"offset":1772}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-4"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"然後，我們可以根據正在檢查的指令邏輯執行更多特定於程式的檢查。","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1,"offset":1776},"end":{"line":55,"column":32,"offset":1807}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1,"offset":1776},"end":{"line":55,"column":32,"offset":1807}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"我們還可以檢查內省指令中存在的帳戶。此步驟需要我們了解帳戶結構的確切結構，因為我們將在特定索引處請求帳戶的數據或公鑰，如下所示：","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1,"offset":1811},"end":{"line":57,"column":65,"offset":1875}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1,"offset":1811},"end":{"line":57,"column":65,"offset":1875}}},{"type":"code","lang":"rust","meta":null,"value":"if !pubkey_eq(instruction.get_account_meta_at(0)?.key(), self.accounts.from.key()) {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidAccountData);\r\n}","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1,"offset":1879},"end":{"line":63,"column":4,"offset":2031}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-5"}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":64,"column":1,"offset":2033}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 使用 Pinocchio 進行指令內省\r\n\r\nPinocchio 使用的類型與 `solana_program` crate 不同。這意味著我們需要為 Pinocchio 創建一個全新且優化的 SDK。\r\n\r\n在 [Orion](https://x.com/BasedOrion_) 的幫助下，我們創建了一組輔助工具，這些工具既尊重了「原始」實現，又使得 `Instruction` sysvar —— 一個使用成本最高的 sysvar —— 成為了效率最高的之一。\r\n\r\n因此，我們可以在 Pinocchio 中使用 *指令內省*，而無需安裝任何外部 crate，並且可以通過導入這些函數來獲取我們所需的所有信息：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nuse pinocchio::sysvars::instructions::Instructions; \r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"如何使用內省\" id=\"how-to-use-introspection\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n如前所述，指令內省只是從 `Instruction` sysvar 帳戶中反序列化數據，以提供我們所需的所有指令相關數據。\r\n\r\n我們首先檢查當前索引。我們可以通過使用 `load_current_index_checked` 函數來完成，如下所示：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nlet instruction_sysvar = unsafe { Instructions::new_unchecked(&self.accounts.sysvar_instructions.try_borrow_data()?) };\r\nlet index = instruction_sysvar.load_current_index();\r\n```\r\n\r\n之後，我們可以使用 `load_instruction_at_checked` 在相對索引處檢查一條指令。這次，我們將檢查執行內省的指令之後的那條指令，如下所示：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n// We load the next instruction, which is the one we want to check for the correct input.\r\nlet instruction = instruction_sysvar.load_instruction_at(index as usize + 1)?;\r\n```\r\n\r\n在進入下一步之前，我們應該問自己，哪些信息對於防止惡意攻擊是必不可少的。\r\n\r\n我們通常從檢查所使用的程序是否是我們預期的開始。在此示例中，我們正在內省系統程序的另一條指令，因此我們可以這樣做：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nif instruction.get_program_id() != &pinocchio_system::ID {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n接下來，我們檢查指令是否是我們預期的。為此，我們將鑑別器和指令數據與預期值進行比較。我們首先創建一個 `instruction_data` 變量並進行檢查，如下所示：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nlet mut instruction_data = [0u8; 12];\r\ninstruction_data[0..4].copy_from_slice(&2u32.to_le_bytes());\r\ninstruction_data[4..12].copy_from_slice(&100_000_000u64.to_le_bytes());\r\n\r\nif instruction.get_instruction_data() != instruction_data {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidInstructionData);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n然後，我們可以根據正在檢查的指令邏輯執行更多特定於程式的檢查。\r\n\r\n我們還可以檢查內省指令中存在的帳戶。此步驟需要我們了解帳戶結構的確切結構，因為我們將在特定索引處請求帳戶的數據或公鑰，如下所示：\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nif !pubkey_eq(instruction.get_account_meta_at(0)?.key(), self.accounts.from.key()) {\r\n    return Err(ProgramError::InvalidAccountData);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"rust","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"use"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":" pinocchio"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"sysvars"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F6F6F4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"instructions"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#F286C4"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"::"}]},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"style":"color:#97E1F1;font-style:italic"},"children":